{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1525996-modified-exalted-setting","id":1525996,"title":"Modified Exalted Setting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-27T03:33:35-08:00","id":1525996,"title":"Modified Exalted Setting","content":"Hey, so lately I have been drawn back to my Exalted phase and I have started to re-examine all kinds of ideas I had for homebrew Exalts and how to integrate them to the setting, alongside other homebrew concepts such as other MMs and modifications to the different realms of existence in the setting. While still WIP (and I am yet to integrate homebrew Exalts into the setting), I've decided to share what I currently have and update it accordingly, so feel free to comment. Just to note about the timeline, I did some color coding so black is meant to be canon, blue apocryphal/optional canon, and red speculation based on canon. One I'll integrate my homebrew, those sections would probably be in some share of gold (depending on how easy it would be to read it, maybe green, we'll see).<br /> <br /> Anyway, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/184X098C6HNvyzt47M8T3GN4WyyPTnFY1tDSMYtcdo3g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here </a>is the link. Feel free to comment <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-03T07:37:52-08:00","id":1526278,"title":"","content":"Finished the entries for Solars, Lunars, Sidereals and Dragon Blooded, including their patrons","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-04T09:22:44-08:00","id":1526323,"title":"","content":"Interesting. Still digesting it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avata